  = note: SCXML 1.0 §3.7: on entering a `<final>` child the processor "MUST generate the event done.state.id" where id is the parent state's ID (a `<parallel>` raises it when a `<final>` is entered in one of its `<state>` regions and every other region is in a final state, §3.7 and Appendix D); every build bounds an event name to 1,024 bytes of UTF-8, so this state could never complete; SCXML 1.0 sets no length, and this is the implementation's bound (spec errata L.6)
  = help: shorten the ID to at most 1,013 bytes and update every reference to it
  = spec: SCXML 1.0 §3.7 <final>

